The screen lights up.
I see my parents.
My mother waves happily.
"Good morning, Maya!" she says.
My father smiles too.
"Hello Mom, hello Dad," I say.
"How is your apartment?" my mother asks.
I turn the laptop.
I show my room.
"That is my table," I say.
"And here is a chair."
I also show my window.
The weather in Berlin is cold.
But my apartment is very warm.
My father nods.
"Are you happy there?" he asks.
"Yes, everything is good," I answer.
